{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">山東青島昨天一艘外籍貨輪起火，造成25人遇難，當局派專家到現場調查起火原因。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.FIRE.FOLO-1300.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20265B6eTzpEwO1789103678.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.FIRE.FOLO-1300.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">搜救工作昨晚完成，當地消防表示船艙三層都有人被困，要分批逐層搜尋失蹤者，增加了救援難度。目前仍有五名傷者留醫，院方稱主要是輕度燒傷，無生命危險。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.FIRE.FOLO-1300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026W6E9PuqooI1789103691.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.FIRE.FOLO-1300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發在昨日上午十一時許，青島市北海造船廠一艘外籍貨輪維修期間起火，一度有多人被困，消防昨晚尋獲所有失蹤者，全部證實身亡。央視報道指，來自全國五個省市的火災調查專家凌晨抵達當地，初步勘查及分析起火原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T05:39:00.663477+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}